(7823341, 1307836, 12200, '<td valign="top">
An amazing, sentimental composition that I adore. I''m genuinely curious whether the "heart" shape in the framing is intentional or incidental--I could see it being either, but it was part of what bumped this one for me in this challenge, especially.</td>', 'An amazing, sentimental composition that I adore. I''m genuinely curious whether the "heart" shape in the framing is intentional or incidental--I could see it being either, but it was part of what bumped this one for me in this challenge, especially.', '2026-06-29 10:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7823343, 1307898, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Mary''s comment below is one I would double-click. Perhaps it''s because I learned so many bad habits from my trial-and-error introduction to photography, but I''ve always found clipping in the highlights--when handled like they are here--to be a really compelling artistic choice. Pure white isn''t necessarily the absence of detail. It''s also the negative space into which the viewer gets to fill in their own interpretive insights. :-)</td>', 'Mary''s comment below is one I would double-click. Perhaps it''s because I learned so many bad habits from my trial-and-error introduction to photography, but I''ve always found clipping in the highlights--when handled like they are here--to be a really compelling artistic choice. Pure white isn''t necessarily the absence of detail. It''s also the negative space into which the viewer gets to fill in their own interpretive insights. :-)', '2026-06-29 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7823344, 1307816, 12200, '<td valign="top">
